# Normalise line endings so the working tree does not churn on Windows.
# * text=auto eol=lf lets git check out LF everywhere while keeping the
#   repository's canonical form as LF (which is what GitHub renders best).

* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must stay CRLF on checkout, for legacy Windows tooling.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.db binary